{"id":"e4a27d2149a6ed33","group":"28","path":"28/28-prop-ph-level-inclusions.md","title":"多项式层级各层的包含关系","display":"prop-ph-level-inclusions — 多项式层级各层的包含关系","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-prop-ph-level-inclusions","aliases":["28-prop-ph-level-inclusions"],"display":"prop-ph-level-inclusions — 多项式层级各层的包含关系","depends_on":["[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","[[28-df-pi-k-p]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 5.3 and Figure 5.1","source_printed_pages":"97–98","source_pdf_pages":"123–124","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-prop-ph-level-inclusions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-prop-ph-level-inclusions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-ph-level-inclusions — 多项式层级各层的包含关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bc4265180c3d2ff\" href=\"?note=2bc4265180c3d2ff\" title=\"28-df-pi-k-p\">28-df-pi-k-p</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 5.3 and Figure 5.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"97–98"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"123–124"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P},\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P},\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 使用所列本地定义的统一多项式证书长度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\cup\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\\subseteq\\Sigma_{k+1}^{\\mathbf P}\\cap\\Pi_{k+1}^{\\mathbf P}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\cup\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\\subseteq\\Sigma_{k+1}^{\\mathbf P}\\cap\\Pi_{k+1}^{\\mathbf P}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>要保持起始量词，末尾增加一个不被谓词使用的相反量词块；要更换起始量词，在最前面增加一个不被使用的量词块。每个量化域非空，虚量词不改变真值。末端谓词仍在FP，故四个包含均成立；k=0时同样添加一个虚量词块。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 5.3 and Figure 5.1；印刷 pp.97–98 / PDF pp.123–124。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-sigma-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"e4f9f10bc85fd486","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pi-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"2bc4265180c3d2ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pi-k-p]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P},\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\cup\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\\subseteq\\Sigma_{k+1}^{\\mathbf P}\\cap\\Pi_{k+1}^{\\mathbf P}.","display":true}],"bytes":1493,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-293","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tisp]]、[[28-thm-sat-time-space-tradeoff]]、[[28-prop-ph-complement-duality]]、[[28-prop-ph-level-inclusions]]。"}],"outgoing":["e4f9f10bc85fd486","2bc4265180c3d2ff"]}